# examples/hola from start to end: the door is locked, the friend gives the key, the chest ends the game.
new
expect_layer PLAY
expect_zone Z01
exit Z02
advance
expect_zone Z01
interact amiga
advance
choose llave
advance
expect llave_dada
expect item:IT_LLAVE
interact amiga
advance
expect_layer PLAY
exit Z02
expect_zone Z02
interact cofre
advance
expect cofre_abierto
expect_layer END
